SupraLINUX Plasma Activities

Official upstream source is unmodified. Six Ubuntu binary package names,
SONAME 7, Multi-Arch declarations and symbol guards are preserved.

WindowSystem and xkbcommon are unused by the signed source; clean sbuild is
the final dependency check. Doxygen/BUILD_QCH were replaced upstream by explicit
ECMGenerateQDoc targets. The common current Frameworks/Plasma build profile does
not run optional QDoc targets. The documentation package ships this explanation;
real QCH generation remains a separate common documentation integration gate.

CTest registers QFlatSetTest. PlasmaActivitiesTest is built upstream but is not
registered and its runner ignores qExec failure values; a zero exit status would
not certify its tests. Our package tests instead exercise actual isolated Ubuntu
kactivitymanagerd through public C++ futures/signals and the installed QML plugin.
Repeat the unchanged Ubuntu client after all six binaries are upgraded, then
compile and run the consumer against the candidate SDK.
